217	 * (a claim is due by its date plus this many days), the terms set for each grade that has its own (by grade; any
218	 * other grade uses the sheet's terms), its late percent (an overdue claim gains it of its figure
219	 * every full 30 days), its rounding policy date (null: blank, the sheet's
