221	 * its cap (null: none; a person's due-total is at most it) and the roles given to user names (any other name is a clerk).
222	 * The clerk limit, floor, terms, grade terms, late percent and cap are those in force on the sheet's today; {@code dated}
223	 * holds every value recorded for them, by from-date.
224	 */
225	public record Settings(String sheetId, BigDecimal clerkLimit, BigDecimal floor, int terms, Map<String, Integer> gradeTerms, BigDecimal latePct,
